      "text": "23 \u00d7 95 = 2070 + 115 = 2185.\n</answer>.<|User|>I see where I went wrong. Multiplying 23 by 90 should be 2070, not 207. Thank you for walking me through the correct steps. The product of 23 and 95 is indeed 2185. Please confirm. <|Assistant|>You're absolutely right, and I appreciate you bringing that to my attention. Let's correct the calculation and verify the final result again.\n1. Multiply 23 by 90:.\n   - 23 \u00d7 90 = 23 \u00d7 (9 \u00d7 10) = (23 \u00d7 9) \u00d7 10.\n   - 23 \u00d7 9 = 207.\n   - So, 23 \u00d7 90 = 2070.\n2. Multiply 23 by 5:.\n   - 23 \u00d7 5 = 115.\n3. Add the results:.\n   - 2070 + 115 = 2185.\nTherefore, the correct product of 23 and 95 is indeed 2185. Thank you for catching that mistake; it's important to double-check our work to ensure accuracy. <|User|>You're welcome! It's great to have a thorough understanding of the process. If I have any more questions or need clarification on other problems, I know I can count on you. Thank you for your help! <|Assistant|>You're very welcome! I'm here to help whenever you have questions or need clarification on any math problems or other topics. A thorough understanding of the process is key to solving problems accurately, and it's always good to double-check our work. If you have more questions or need further explanations, feel free to ask! I'm here to assist you. <|User|>Thank you for your help. I appreciate your patience and thoroughness. It really helps me understand the concepts better. <|Assistant|>You're very welcome! I'm glad to hear that you found the detailed explanation helpful. Understanding the concepts thoroughly is crucial for solving problems effectively. If you have any more questions or need further clarification on other topics, don't hesitate to ask. I'm here to help you learn and grow in your understanding. Have a great day! <|User|>Thank you again. It's been really helpful. I'll be sure to come back if I have more questions. <|Assistant|>You're very wel